        Draw Text "Draws / Triangles" At PanelText, 262 Size 12 Color LIGHT_GRAY
        Draw Number Graphics3D.DrawCallCount3D() At PanelLeft + 148, 262 Size 12 Color WHITE
        Draw Number Graphics3D.SubmittedTriangleCount3D() At PanelLeft + 192, 262 Size 12 Color WHITE
        Draw Text "Demo / Next" At PanelText, 284 Size 12 Color LIGHT_GRAY
